WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.125
The lesson is simple but powerful.

00:00:02.205 --> 00:00:06.469
Certifying a whole set of nodes together, instead
of one at a time,

00:00:06.549 --> 00:00:12.110
transforms a near-useless zero percent guarantee
into an eighty percent certified ratio

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:14.185
against graph injection attacks.

00:00:14.265 --> 00:00:17.557
A customized linear relaxation keeps this tractable,

00:00:17.637 --> 00:00:20.734
solving in about a minute even for large attacks.

00:00:20.814 --> 00:00:25.014
It is a concrete step toward provable defenses that
are practical,

00:00:25.094 --> 00:00:27.996
and because it shares the same smoothed model,

00:00:28.076 --> 00:00:34.740
it plugs right in alongside existing sample-wise
certificates to stay strong across every attack budget.
